{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.31:0.3"], "en": "Catutthavagga (The Fourth Chapter)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.31:0.4"], "en": "The Verses of the Elder Migasira:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.31:1.1", "PA_thag_2.31:1.2"], "en": "“Since I went forth into homelessness in the teaching of the Perfectly Enlightened One, ...”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.31:1.3"], "en": "Being liberated, I rose up;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.31:1.4", "PA_thag_2.31:2.1"], "en": "I transcended the realm of desire while Brahmā looked on.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.31:2.2"], "en": "Then my mind was liberated;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.31:2.3", "PA_thag_2.31:2.4"], "en": "through the destruction of all fetters, my liberation is unshakable.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.31:2.5"], "en": "… The Elder Migasira …", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
